        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、【2024 长春理工大学 2】某系统微分方程为 $y''(t) + 3y'(t) + 2y(t) = f''(t) +$",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            137,
            811,
            154
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$2f(t)$ ，当 $f(t) = u(t)$ 时，全响应 $y(t) = (1 - e^{-t} + 2e^{-2t})u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
