    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、【2024 大连理工大学四改编】某系统微分方程为",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            589,
            124
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 r ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 r (t) = - e ^ {\\prime} (t) - 6 e (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            342,
            131,
            648,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 求单位冲激响应 $h(t)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            157,
            400,
            173
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 判断系统的稳定性;",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            182,
            389,
            197
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 已知 $r_{zi}(0) = 2, r_{zi}'(0) = -1$ ，以及 $e(t) = 4e^{-3t}u(t)$ ，求系统的零输入响应、零状态响应和全响应，并判断自然、受迫，瞬态和稳态响应分量。",
